r` — telemetry status strip with `.status-val`\n- `.badge`, `.badge-{STATUS}` variants: DEFECT, PASS, UNCERTAIN, NOVEL, CRITICAL, WARNING, OPTIMAL, HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW\n- `.evidence-box`, `.evidence-box.{LEVEL}` variants: HIGH, CRITICAL, MEDIUM, WARNING, LOW, OPTIMAL\n- `.stat-card` with `.val`, `.lbl`, `.sub` — new custom metric card\n- `.section-divider` — glowing gradient line separator\n- `.util-bar-wrap` / `.util-bar-fill` / `.util-bar-fill.danger` / `.util-bar-fill.warn` — progress bars\n\n### MATLAB ANN Forward Pass\n$$\\hat{y} = \\text{mapminmax}^{-1}\\Big(b_2 + LW_{2,1} \\cdot \\tanh(b_1 + IW_{1,1} \\cdot \\text{mapminmax}(x))\\Big)$$\nAll 13 models: 2-layer feedforward, 10 hidden neurons, `tansig` activation, `purelin` output.\n- Model1ANN, Model2ANN: 1 input → 3 outputs\n- Cell-station models (c1s2ANN etc.): 4 inputs → 1 output\n\n### Critical Anti-Patterns\n- **Do NOT use `st.session_state.raw_data`** — use `st.session_state.get('model_data', {})`\n- **Do NOT pass `yaxis` both inside `_base_layout()` and as separate kwarg** to `fig.update_layout()` — causes \"multiple values\" error\n- **Do NOT call `pd.read_excel()` without `nrows` on files >20MB** — causes memory exhaustion\n\n---\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited Files\n| File | What Changed | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\app.py` | Lines 42–539: Complete CSS replacement with new premium design system. Old orphan CSS block (was lines 541–861, now removed). File is now 1,418 lines. | Major UI overhaul |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\modules\\ann_surrogate.py` | NEW FILE — ANN engine | Digital Twin feature |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\utils\\chart_helpers.py` | Added `ann_prediction_gauge()`, `ann_sweep_curve()`, `ann_validation_scatter()` at end | ANN visualizations |\n| `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\modules\\production_analyzer.py` | Upd